      "cooked": "<p>I did a cursory look but couldn't find an existent topic about this.</p><p>Is there any momentum/support for SotM specific card sleeves? &nbsp;(Ones that would have SotM artwork or somesuch on them?) I'm seriously looking at picking up some sleeves to protect my cards, which have started taking a beating, but I'd hate to buy the 1000+ sleeves it would take to cover all the cards, only to find out a half a year down the road that GtG was putting out SotM themed sleeves.</p>",
