      "cooked": "<p>I don't think they're planning on doing anything like that.&nbsp; It has been stated before that sleeving the game would cost more than just outright buying it again.&nbsp; And the cards are hardy.&nbsp; I recommend the Mayday Premium Greens if you're looking for a good sleeve for SotM cards.</p>",
