      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/22d042/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-08-24T20:49:52.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>That's cool. &nbsp;I've been running a lot of demos for new players, many of whom shuffle my cards like poker decks, so my babies are starting to get the snot beat out of them. &nbsp;I'll just pick up penny sleeves. &nbsp;(I know it would be expensive. &nbsp;I may have made an error in calculation, but my figure for number of cards in the game so far, barring promos, was somewhere in the 1600 range. &nbsp;Super expensive with more durable sleeves, but penny sleeves will come in at a reasonable amount of money.)</p>",
